# API Information


main: {
  kit: {
    info: {
      contact: {
        email: "support@vidsmaller.com"
        name: "VidSmaller Support"
        url: "https://vidsmaller.com/api-docs"
      }
      description: `Check platform upload limits, estimate a safe target size, and run asynchronous target-size video compression jobs. Read-only endpoints need no key. Uploads and compression jobs use a VidSmaller bearer API key and account credits. The GET job-status and job-download operations were removed because they need a VidSmaller API key (401 without one).

\`sizeMb\` on GET /api/v1/estimate is marked required: the API answers 400 without \`sizeBytes\` or \`sizeMb\` (verified 2026-10-25).`
